 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you doing? That's a lot of water. Is it heavy rain or storms? Then you ready. Bring the tent up on a flat, dry spot first, then pitch the caravan around it. Okay, here it is again. Then bring the caravan up last, with the tent inside it. And put a board under the front jack. Wet soil loads the jack and can bend it. Then keep the door open with fan and dry your boots on a mat outside. And dry the caravan roof as much as you can.",
